        "title": "AccountSampleTriggerHandlerTest",
        "fileName": "AccountSampleTriggerHandlerTest.html",
        "text": "AccountSampleTriggerHandlerTest Tests for the sample handler and the sample trigger. Each test proves 1 behavior through real DML. AccountSampleTriggerHandler.finishedOperations  is the call log: andFinally()  adds each operation that the handler finished. The test DML and the queries that read the results back run in system mode, so FlagSystemMode  is suppressed for the class. The tests set up and check data directly: the access under test is the handler's own, which states system mode on purpose. Signature private inherited sharing class AccountSampleTriggerHandlerTest See AccountSampleTriggerHandler Author David Schach Since 2021 2026-10-30 1 test per behavior, with the finished operations as the call log AccountSampleTriggerHandlerTest Properties Name Signature HANDLER_NAME private static final String HANDLER_NAME AccountSampleTriggerHandlerTest Methods andFinallyRunsAfterEveryContext() andFinally()  runs after all 7 contexts, also the contexts that the handler does not override. bulkInsertStaysInsideLoopLimit() A bulk insert of more than 200 records runs in chunks, and the loop limit does not stop any chunk. bypassIsClearedAfterChildUpdate() The handler clears its own bypass after it updates the child Accounts. childInSameUpdateKeepsItsOwnPhone() A child Account in the same update as its parent keeps the phone number of its own update, because a trigger cannot update the records it is running for. childUpdateDoesNotRunHandlerAgain() The update of the child Accounts does not run the handler again, because the handler bypasses itself for it. constructorsRegisterTheHandlerName() The no-arg constructor registers the class name, and the String constructor forwards the name it is given. insertAccount(name) Insert an Account with the given name. insertChildAccount(parentId) Insert a child Account of the given parent. insertNormalizesName() An insert removes the extra spaces from the Account name. nameOf(accountId) Read the stored name of an Account. phoneChangeCopiesToChildAccounts() A changed phone number is copied to the child Accounts. updateLeavesUnchangedNameAlone() An update that does not change the name leaves it as it is. updateNormalizesChangedName() An update that changes the name removes the extra spaces from the new name. andFinallyRunsAfterEveryContext() andFinally()  runs after all 7 contexts, also the contexts that the handler does not override. Signature @IsTest private static void andFinallyRunsAfterEveryContext() bulkInsertStaysInsideLoopLimit() A bulk insert of more than 200 records runs in chunks, and the loop limit does not stop any chunk. Signature @IsTest private static void bulkInsertStaysInsideLoopLimit() bypassIsClearedAfterChildUpdate() The handler clears its own bypass after it updates the child Accounts. Signature @IsTest private static void bypassIsClearedAfterChildUpdate() childInSameUpdateKeepsItsOwnPhone() A child Account in the same update as its parent keeps the phone number of its own update, because a trigger cannot update the records it is running for. Signature @IsTest private static void childInSameUpdateKeepsItsOwnPhone() childUpdateDoesNotRunHandlerAgain() The update of the child Accounts does not run the handler again, because the handler bypasses itself for it. Signature @IsTest private static void childUpdateDoesNotRunHandlerAgain() constructorsRegisterTheHandlerName() The no-arg constructor registers the class name, and the String constructor forwards the name it is given. Signature @IsTest private static void constructorsRegisterTheHandlerName() insertAccount(name) Insert an Account with the given name. Signature private static Account insertAccount(String name) Parameters name Type: String The Account name. Returns Account  The inserted Account. insertChildAccount(parentId) Insert a child Account of the given parent. Signature private static Account insertChildAccount(Id parentId) Parameters parentId Type: Id The Id of the parent Account. Returns Account  The inserted child Account. insertNormalizesName() An insert removes the extra spaces from the Account name. Signature @IsTest private static void insertNormalizesName() nameOf(accountId) Read the stored name of an Account. Signature private static String nameOf(Id accountId) Parameters accountId Type: Id The Account Id. Returns String  The name in the database. phoneChangeCopiesToChildAccounts() A changed phone number is copied to the child Accounts. Signature @IsTest private static void phoneChangeCopiesToChildAccounts() updateLeavesUnchangedNameAlone() An update that does not change the name leaves it as it is. Signature @IsTest private static void updateLeavesUnchangedNameAlone() updateNormalizesChangedName() An update that changes the name removes the extra spaces from the new name. Signature @IsTest private static void updateNormalizesChangedName()"
